---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import meetingImage from '../assets/images/office-meeting-salad-water.png';
---

<section class="py-20 md:py-28">
	<div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl items-center gap-12 px-4 md:grid-cols-2">
		<Image
			src={meetingImage}
			alt="Coworkers laughing during a meeting with fresh salads and bottled water on the table"
			widths={[480, 768, 1100]}
			sizes="(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw"
			class="w-full rounded-soft shadow-xl"
		/>
		<div>
			<p class="eyebrow">Why it matters</p>
			<h2 class="mt-3 text-4xl uppercase md:text-5xl">Break Rooms Your Team Looks Forward To</h2>
			<p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
				A good break room is more than a snack stop. It keeps people on site, gives them a minute to
				recharge, and shows them you care.
			</p>
			<p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
				Fresh salads, cold water, and good coffee turn a quick break into a better workday. We make
				that easy for DFW businesses, at no cost to you.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
